  "id": "tsd",
  "term": "TSD",
  "definition": "TSD stands for total sleep deprivation, meaning staying awake for a full night without sleep. In depression research, one night of TSD has been noted to produce a rapid but short-lived improvement in mood in many patients, making it useful for studying fast antidepressant effects.",
